{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300eDuola Mage\u300f is a retro adventure action game wrapped in a two-dimensional anime style. It abandons the 'ultra-fast' combat mode where characters are hard to see amid chaos, allowing every move and attack to be clear and solid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have set up a wide variety of weapons, including greatswords, katanas, bows, staves, gauntlets, etc., and each weapon has unique skills\u2014yes, every single weapon does. All weapon equipment can be upgraded, and we also pay homage to some classic monster weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players can possess multiple characters at the same time and switch between them freely during combat. Each character has a unique appearance and fighting style, such as the heavy and brutal female warrior, the agile and nimble elven archer, the elegant and carefree swordsman, and the glamorous yet violent time-space mage. We strive to make each character's combat distinct; we don\u2019t want switching characters to just be a change in visual effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, we have developed 11 mainline levels. The later dungeons are more like intricate miniature worlds. Each map contains hidden bosses and treasure chests and buffs that require climbing to reach, greatly increasing players' desire to explore. The natural environments in dungeons are also diverse, including the deep and mysterious tree spirit forest, the vast and majestic mineral desert, the hellish lava pits, and the misty, spooky spider nests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides the mainline levels, the other main gameplay mode is the Trials. This is a roguelike mode familiar to many. In the Trials, monsters are strengthened on each floor, and after defeating a wave of monsters, players receive a choice of three buffs. We set up the Trials leaderboard, and players who reach the highest floor can earn special titles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u25cf Intense battles with clearly defined classes</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Samurai \u2014 Iaido slash, instant dash slash; seize the right moment, cold sword to the throat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/77650486d50da96046d34483ceb344cd.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=974 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/77650486d50da96046d34483ceb344cd.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/77650486d50da96046d34483ceb344cd.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mage \u2014 Space-time spells, black holes and meteorites, ultimate clearing skills, crazy farming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/db4fd59b321238fd8b5a00d6d4b7c412.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=960 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/db4fd59b321238fd8b5a00d6d4b7c412.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/db4fd59b321238fd8b5a00d6d4b7c412.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/5ad951fd5878c246b7b92fa5f3438e8e.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=960 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/5ad951fd5878c246b7b92fa5f3438e8e.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/5ad951fd5878c246b7b92fa5f3438e8e.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Druids \u2014 Werewolves, Thunder Eagles, embody the explosive power of nature and beastliness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/36b607d24144b1d71fdf114f6947c905.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=960 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/36b607d24144b1d71fdf114f6947c905.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/36b607d24144b1d71fdf114f6947c905.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/a26d2ed6d1d08759bd3ffb4d29aa558c.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=960 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/a26d2ed6d1d08759bd3ffb4d29aa558c.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/a26d2ed6d1d08759bd3ffb4d29aa558c.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phoenix \u2014 summon fire dragons and the song of the phoenix, integrating the art of fire into combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/27d1e1e8532766eec0d4c22a72f8c3db.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=960 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/27d1e1e8532766eec0d4c22a72f8c3db.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/27d1e1e8532766eec0d4c22a72f8c3db.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/1cb4739194c3f0b5b4dbaed7346ac42c.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=960 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/1cb4739194c3f0b5b4dbaed7346ac42c.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/1cb4739194c3f0b5b4dbaed7346ac42c.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elf Archer \u2014 Explosive Dragon Arrow, Dragon-Catching Kick, agile movements, and perfect accuracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/b5d311445d8eb8435abae904dbca4a82.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=960 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/b5d311445d8eb8435abae904dbca4a82.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/b5d311445d8eb8435abae904dbca4a82.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The Valkyrie descendant\u2014the Wrath of the God of War faces the dragon head-on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/0add2cdb2ac8a7807bb5563d10291ce0.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=1170 height=610 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/0add2cdb2ac8a7807bb5563d10291ce0.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/0add2cdb2ac8a7807bb5563d10291ce0.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>&quot;The 'violent meat grinder' instantly tears through the enemy's defenses.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/d5cb01043f48b0d08a53a5a9a4656b1c.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=1170 height=610 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/d5cb01043f48b0d08a53a5a9a4656b1c.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/d5cb01043f48b0d08a53a5a9a4656b1c.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u25cf Multiplayer gameplay</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit your friends to fight monsters and loot treasures together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/d2855a01ab40cb37b63ba69decea5a16.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=960 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/d2855a01ab40cb37b63ba69decea5a16.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/d2855a01ab40cb37b63ba69decea5a16.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u25cf Your own cherry blossom island</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize furniture in the cabin, grow vegetables, and raise animals (of course to eat them!), and you can also open it up to let other players come and consume!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/3931851e3be96883af3ad0569e43d593.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=960 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/3931851e3be96883af3ad0569e43d593.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/3931851e3be96883af3ad0569e43d593.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4133550?t=1766163649","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/14c8bab6dd19b0ad4d3de237c21657c015c19105/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766163649","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/d12c9e9df6f90b24c2d96a3d80536f719c77a6ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766163649","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/d12c9e9df6f90b24c2d96a3d80536f719c77a6ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766163649","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300eDuola Mage\u300f is a retro adventure action game wrapped in a two-dimensional anime style. It abandons the 'ultra-fast' combat mode where characters are hard to see amid chaos, allowing every move and attack to be clear and solid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have set up a wide variety of weapons, including greatswords, katanas, bows, staves, gauntlets, etc., and each weapon has unique skills\u2014yes, every single weapon does. All weapon equipment can be upgraded, and we also pay homage to some classic monster weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players can possess multiple characters at the same time and switch between them freely during combat. Each character has a unique appearance and fighting style, such as the heavy and brutal female warrior, the agile and nimble elven archer, the elegant and carefree swordsman, and the glamorous yet violent time-space mage. We strive to make each character's combat distinct; we don\u2019t want switching characters to just be a change in visual effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, we have developed 11 mainline levels. The later dungeons are more like intricate miniature worlds. Each map contains hidden bosses and treasure chests and buffs that require climbing to reach, greatly increasing players' desire to explore. The natural environments in dungeons are also diverse, including the deep and mysterious tree spirit forest, the vast and majestic mineral desert, the hellish lava pits, and the misty, spooky spider nests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides the mainline levels, the other main gameplay mode is the Trials. This is a roguelike mode familiar to many. In the Trials, monsters are strengthened on each floor, and after defeating a wave of monsters, players receive a choice of three buffs. We set up the Trials leaderboard, and players who reach the highest floor can earn special titles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u25cf Intense battles with clearly defined classes</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Samurai \u2014 Iaido slash, instant dash slash; seize the right moment, cold sword to the throat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/77650486d50da96046d34483ceb344cd.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=974 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/77650486d50da96046d34483ceb344cd.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/77650486d50da96046d34483ceb344cd.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mage \u2014 Space-time spells, black holes and meteorites, ultimate clearing skills, crazy farming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/db4fd59b321238fd8b5a00d6d4b7c412.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=960 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/db4fd59b321238fd8b5a00d6d4b7c412.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/db4fd59b321238fd8b5a00d6d4b7c412.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/5ad951fd5878c246b7b92fa5f3438e8e.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=960 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/5ad951fd5878c246b7b92fa5f3438e8e.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/5ad951fd5878c246b7b92fa5f3438e8e.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Druids \u2014 Werewolves, Thunder Eagles, embody the explosive power of nature and beastliness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/36b607d24144b1d71fdf114f6947c905.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=960 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/36b607d24144b1d71fdf114f6947c905.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/36b607d24144b1d71fdf114f6947c905.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/a26d2ed6d1d08759bd3ffb4d29aa558c.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=960 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/a26d2ed6d1d08759bd3ffb4d29aa558c.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/a26d2ed6d1d08759bd3ffb4d29aa558c.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phoenix \u2014 summon fire dragons and the song of the phoenix, integrating the art of fire into combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/27d1e1e8532766eec0d4c22a72f8c3db.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=960 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/27d1e1e8532766eec0d4c22a72f8c3db.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/27d1e1e8532766eec0d4c22a72f8c3db.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/1cb4739194c3f0b5b4dbaed7346ac42c.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=960 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/1cb4739194c3f0b5b4dbaed7346ac42c.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/1cb4739194c3f0b5b4dbaed7346ac42c.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elf Archer \u2014 Explosive Dragon Arrow, Dragon-Catching Kick, agile movements, and perfect accuracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/b5d311445d8eb8435abae904dbca4a82.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=960 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/b5d311445d8eb8435abae904dbca4a82.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/b5d311445d8eb8435abae904dbca4a82.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The Valkyrie descendant\u2014the Wrath of the God of War faces the dragon head-on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/0add2cdb2ac8a7807bb5563d10291ce0.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=1170 height=610 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/0add2cdb2ac8a7807bb5563d10291ce0.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/0add2cdb2ac8a7807bb5563d10291ce0.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>&quot;The 'violent meat grinder' instantly tears through the enemy's defenses.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/d5cb01043f48b0d08a53a5a9a4656b1c.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=1170 height=610 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/d5cb01043f48b0d08a53a5a9a4656b1c.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/d5cb01043f48b0d08a53a5a9a4656b1c.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u25cf Multiplayer gameplay</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit your friends to fight monsters and loot treasures together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/d2855a01ab40cb37b63ba69decea5a16.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=960 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/d2855a01ab40cb37b63ba69decea5a16.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/d2855a01ab40cb37b63ba69decea5a16.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u25cf Your own cherry blossom island</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize furniture in the cabin, grow vegetables, and raise animals (of course to eat them!), and you can also open it up to let other players come and consume!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/3931851e3be96883af3ad0569e43d593.poster.avif?t=1766163649\" width=960 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/3931851e3be96883af3ad0569e43d593.webm?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/extras/3931851e3be96883af3ad0569e43d593.mp4?t=1766163649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["HaoWu","Shield Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133550/863e61d3877c9ad7b3043e065853b93c681173eb/header.jpg?t=1766163649","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4133550/1008409168/0ffa814151a5d6a13a11f2b5258100daf9ccd306/1761378164/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762444895"